{
  "id": "hydraulic_pump_volume_capacity",
  "title": "Hydraulic Pump Volume Capacity",
  "description": "Calculate hydraulic pump volume capacity in both Imperial (gpm) and Metric (l/s) units based on cylinder area, piston stroke, and time for full stroke.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Hydraulic Pump Volume Capacity Calculator\n\nCalculate the required pump output capacity for hydraulic cylinders using either Imperial or Metric units.\n\n**Imperial Formula:** q = 0.26 × A × s / t (gpm)\n\n**Metric Formula:** q = 10⁻⁶ × A × s / t (l/s)\n\nWhere:\n- q = pump output capacity\n- A = area of cylinder\n- s = piston stroke\n- t = required time for full stroke"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "unit_system",
          "label": "Unit System",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Imperial (gpm)",
              "value": "imperial"
            },
            {
              "label": "Metric (l/s)",
              "value": "metric"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "imperial"
        },
        {
          "id": "area",
          "label": "Cylinder Area",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "in² / mm²",
          "defaultValue": 7.065
        },
        {
          "id": "stroke",
          "label": "Piston Stroke",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "in / mm",
          "defaultValue": 30
        },
        {
          "id": "time",
          "label": "Time for Full Stroke",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "s",
          "defaultValue": 3
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "capacity_imperial",
          "label": "Pump Capacity (Imperial)",
          "formula": "inputs.unit_system === 'imperial' ? 0.26 * inputs.area * inputs.stroke / inputs.time : null",
          "unit": "gpm",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "capacity_metric",
          "label": "Pump Capacity (Metric)",
          "formula": "inputs.unit_system === 'metric' ? 1e-6 * inputs.area * inputs.stroke / inputs.time : null",
          "unit": "l/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}